    {
      "id": "f377ff43d272c7bd035947a2aa0f9de3aba3b28699e1a2179b791fb3cc4a4f0a",
      "name": "Lodash has Prototype Pollution Vulnerability in `_.unset` and `_.omit` functions",
      "description": "Lodash versions 4.0.0 through 4.17.22 are vulnerable to prototype pollution in the `_.unset` and `_.omit` functions. An attacker can pass crafted paths which cause Lodash to delete methods from global prototypes.\n\nThe issue permits deletion of properties but does not allow overwriting their original behavior.",
